  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gunkol Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at expanding the production capacity as well as broaden the product mix of the Gunkol Plant which is engaged in manufacturing of cooking appliances. The project envisages investment in powder paint, enameling facilities and new product moulds (for sheet metal forming), in addition to the required working capital increase. The investment is targeted to increase the annual capacity of Gunkol from 850,000 to 1.20 million ovens/year by 2005.

Gunkol is part of the Teba Group of companies.  IDB agreed to purchase from the Company the equipment specified and to lease_back the equipment to the Company pursuant to leaseback agreement under Sukuk Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
